  {
   "text": "Every year Nora says the same thing.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.362
  },
  {
   "text": "Next year, the Smokies. Or Utah. Or Yellowstone.",
   "start": 2.812,
   "end": 5.965
  },
  {
   "text": "And every year, nothing gets planned.",
   "start": 6.415,
   "end": 8.364
  },
  {
   "text": "So this Christmas, Daniel wrapped all three.",
   "start": 8.814,
   "end": 11.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Three trip planning guides: when to go, where to stay, itineraries built around the best day hikes, and the safety rules for each park.",
   "start": 11.582,
   "end": 19.598
  },
  {
   "text": "On Christmas morning they circled the first dates on the calendar.",
   "start": 20.048,
   "end": 23.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for the hiker on your list.",
   "start": 23.952,
   "end": 25.808
  }
 ],
